// Rule: [T1053.005] UNC7017 Crossroad - Radmincomponentruntime Famitrfc Runtimechk
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1053.005
// Classification: Hunting query
// Status: Untested implementation sketch
// Primary platform: Microsoft Defender XDR
// Required telemetry: DeviceProcessEvents
// Purpose: Hunting query for radmincomponentruntime famitrfc runtimechk, with evidence boundaries and target-environment validation requirements
// Logic: Evaluate DeviceProcessEvents for radmincomponentruntime famitrfc runtimechk using the existing source-derived conditions while preserving projected investigation context.
// A match proves: A result proves that the published query conditions matched in DeviceProcessEvents; it is an investigative event, not a malicious verdict.
// A match does not prove: task creation, DLL hijacking, successful C2, supply-chain delivery, compromise, or UNC7017 attribution.
// Expected false positives: authorized administration, approved software, testing, or benign artifact collisions.
// Coverage limits: local schema, field population, retention, collection scope, and attacker variation require validation.
// Evidence claims: C001, C002, C003
//
// Hunting query - Untested implementation sketch
// Classification: Hunting query | Confidence: Medium
// Primary platform: Microsoft Defender XDR advanced hunting
// Telemetry: DeviceProcessEvents
// Source-observed behavior: RadminComponentRuntime executes the signed Radmin
// binary from %LOCALAPPDATA%\Radmin with --runtimechk. FamItrf2.exe is an
// observed alternative. A match does not prove task creation, DLL hijacking,
// successful C2, supply-chain delivery, compromise, or UNC7017 attribution.
DeviceProcessEvents
| where FileName in~ ("FamItrfc.exe", "FamItrf2.exe")
| where FolderPath contains @"\AppData\Local\Radmin\"
| where ProcessCommandLine contains "--runtimechk"
| project Timestamp, DeviceId, DeviceName, AccountName,
          FileName, FolderPath, ProcessCommandLine,
          InitiatingProcessFileName, InitiatingProcessCommandLine,
          ReportId
| order by Timestamp desc
